WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.853
The Data Catalogue is where you find data and add it to the map. Here is how it works.

00:00:08.683 --> 00:00:12.447
Click Explore data to open the catalogue.

00:00:13.109 --> 00:00:20.257
Datasets are grouped into eleven themes. Expand any group to browse what it holds.

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:28.288
Faster than browsing, search by name. Here we look for a vegetation index.

00:00:28.947 --> 00:00:34.226
Select the dataset to preview it, then click Add to the map.

00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:42.981
The layer now appears in the workbench, ready to zoom, restyle or remove.

00:00:43.641 --> 00:00:49.975
That is the Data Catalogue. The guide below covers every option in detail.
